Z||000012||chester||09-09-2001||09:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by sqoach:<BR><B>Cool pics!<P>Chester, how in the world do you drive that thing!?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> Can you even fit your foot under it?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually its not that bad now that I have gotten used to it.  It dosen't scrape often and its normally just the front skirt. I do tend to pay attention to the road more now. And no, my son can't fit his foot under the car.  But then he takes a size 14 shoe!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">   <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension||||reg||1
